cff-version: 1.2.0
message: 'If you refer to Coffer in your work, please cite it using these metadata.'
type: software
title: Coffer
abstract: >-
  Coffer is a free, open-source, local-first desktop accounting and ERP application for
  small and medium businesses in India. It keeps double-entry books, computes GST on
  invoices, tracks receivables, payables and stock, and stores each company as one
  encrypted SQLite file on the user's own computer.
authors:
  - name: The Coffer contributors
repository-code: 'https://github.com/abinauv/coffer'
url: 'https://github.com/abinauv/coffer'
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
keywords:
  - accounting software
  - ERP
  - GST
  - India
  - MSME
  - small business
  - double-entry bookkeeping
  - invoicing
  - inventory management
  - local-first
  - offline-first
